Description&#xA;




Electric saw&#xA;
Ideal for cutting wood quickly, boosting work efficiency.&#xA;


Hand saw&#xA;
Perfect for intricate cutting tasks, particularly in tight spaces.&#xA;


Drill&#xA;
Used to make holes in wood, making assembly and fixing accessories easier.&#xA;


